 "library": {
  "title": "UiO-67 MOF unit cell, polyhedral",
  "description": "UiO-67, the zirconium biphenyl-4,4'-dicarboxylate MOF, as its conventional cubic unit cell (Fm-3m, a = 2.68 nm), in nanometres. 680 atoms: Zr6O4(OH)4 clusters (OH hydrogens omitted) joined by 24 BPDC linkers with ring hydrogens. VESTA style: small balls, two-coloured bonds, translucent ZrO8 polyhedra, VESTA colours. Built geometrically from the UiO-66 cluster with longer linkers (rings coplanar), not refined from a CIF.",
